                "text": "The House GOP will always support America\u2019s active-duty military personnel and our nation\u2019s veterans. This year\u2019s \u201cMilcon/VA\u201d appropriations bill will fully fund our veterans\u2019 health care and benefits programs to ensure they receive the timely care they have rightfully earned. https://t.co/HMvEVijf6b",
