                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Just heard the news of @SteveScalise\u2019s diagnosis. There is not a better person in the US House or in politics than Steve. He has overcome great medical challenges before, & if there's anyone who can overcome this challenge, it\u2019s him. God Bless Steve and the entire Scalise family.",
