                "reply_count": 12,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Guthrie Robert Packer Hospital in Sayre has been providing top-notch healthcare services to the entire northern tier of Pennsylvania for more than 130 years. In that time, they\u2019ve continued to utilize technological advancements in the medical field to improve patient care, and I was incredibly impressed to see how they\u2019re incorporating AI into the hospital. I enjoyed touring the facility today and appreciated the opportunity to meet with the hospital\u2019s senior leadership. We had a great discussion about the challenges facing healthcare providers and legislation I\u2019m working on to address issues such as nursing shortages.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
