                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I was happy to meet a group with the American College of Obstetricians and Gynecologists today. Doctors and medical students from across Pennsylvania\u2019s Ninth District visited my Washington office to discuss issues related to Medicare reimbursements, maternity care services, and more. \u00a0I appreciate the organization\u2019s efforts to advocate for improved patient care across the country, especially in rural areas.",
