                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This weekend, my wife Shelley and I had the joy of watching both our daughters graduate\u2014Caroline from George Washington University\u2019s School of Medicine and Jacqueline from Hofstra Law School. Their hard work, perseverance, and commitment to serving others is so gratifying. Congratulations to all of this year\u2019s graduates, and to their parents and families. God speed!",
