                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Had a fantastic tour of Downtown Lebanon today, connecting with incredible local businesses that truly embody our community\u2019s spirit! \n\nHuge thanks to Janelle at Queen\u2019s Natural Market for showcasing their exceptional health food offerings and to Melody Vincent at Lebanon Picture Frames and Fine Arts Gallery for sharing insights on the local art scene and preserving cherished memories. \n\nAppreciated the conversation with Audrey Heagy and Dave Hopkins at Spherion Staffing Services on their vital work connecting job seekers with opportunities in our region. \n\nThese businesses are the heart of our local economy and I am committed to supporting them and all small businesses in Congress.",
