                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This evening, I was happy to attend a Department of Veterans Affairs reception hosted by Secretary Doug Collins to discuss the VA\u2019s work serving our nation\u2019s heroes.\n \nFrom making the agency more efficient to expanding caregiver support and improving mental health access, the VA is making key strides. I\u2019ll continue working to ensure PA-09 veterans\u2014nearly 45,000 strong\u2014receive the care and benefits they\u2019ve earned.",
